---
title: Uncle Roger's Favorite Pickled Mushrooms
source: Oma
---

In a tightly sealed jar, shake the @Italian salad dressing mix{1%package}, @tarragon or apple cider vinegar{1/3%cup} and @water{2%tbsp}.

Add @salad or canola oil{2/3%cup}, @sugar{1%tbsp}, @garlic{4%cloves} and @hot sauce{6%drops} and shake again to mix.

Place @button mushrooms{2%cans (4 oz each)}(drained) and @mushroom stems and pieces{1%can (6 oz)}(drained) in a #large bowl{}, then add @onion{1%medium}(thinly sliced into rings). Pour the pickling solution over the mixed mushrooms and onions.

Cover and refrigerate for at least ~{1%overnight}.

Serve with a slotted spoon.

> Makes approximately two cups.
